Bugglebrook artwork

Provenance note: the current files directly in art/src/bugs/ and art/src/faces/
are an agent-created Krita reference set, described in REFERENCE-SET.md, and
art/src/sets/storybook/ is a second agent-created set, described in
STORYBOOK-SET.md. Neither is attributed to the human artist. The ownership and
permission statements below concern her original drawings, including future
named sets. This file grants no additional permissions for either agent-created
set. The exclusion from the code license applies to every art set.

Copyright (c) 2026 the artist. All rights reserved.

These terms cover the artist's drawings in art/ and the atlases generated from
them in src/renderer/art/. The artist owns her drawings outright.

The artwork is not part of the Bugglebrook code. Whatever license covers the
code, now or later, does not cover these files. If the code is ever released
under an open-source license, art/ and src/renderer/art/ stay excluded.

Bugglebrook builds include the artwork with the artist's permission. No one
may copy, change, or use it anywhere else, including other games, merchandise,
or AI training, without her written permission.

The plan, as of October 2026: the artist publishes Bugglebrook herself once
she is 18, so she needs no license to her own art, and the code is licensed
to her by its author. If anyone else publishes the game, that publisher needs
a separate written agreement with the artist, signed after her 18th birthday.

This file records ownership. It is not legal advice; have the final wording
checked before the game is sold.
